{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415041","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415041","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1041504101:1":{"text":"You're a tough one, I'll grant you that—but don't flatter yourself. You're hardly exceptional.","source_cn":"你是难缠的对手，但你还不够格成为那万中无一。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x81B02E70D7FCA336","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041504102:1":{"text":"Hmph, what makes you think you can give me advice, you Dead Tide scum?","source_cn":"哼，死潮舰队的舰长，竟然想教我怎么做老大？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9240A0ED6CD0BFEB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041504103:1":{"text":"Last I checked, we aren't exactly friends.","source_cn":"真稀奇，我们好像不是朋友吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4A91B665107AD277","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041504104:1":{"text":"Maybe you ought to be grateful. I abandoned Tesio first, clearing the way for you to take him out.","source_cn":"怎么，你不应该感谢我吗？泰西欧是被我抛弃的无用棋子，你...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB9A0028CE64F5B59","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041504105:1":{"text":"And Nara? I dredged her up from the sea's depths—she'd still be rotting in the mud if not for me.","source_cn":"还有奈拉，如果不是我唤醒了海底的她……她到现在都和其他...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC0F3B6D03A28CE2E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041504106:1":{"text":"After all, you sacrificed your sister and father to claw your way to the top. Don't you owe me a bit of gratitude?","source_cn":"抛弃了妹妹和父亲坐上这个位置的你，难道不应该感谢我吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5E0A7FE5509F8DD8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041504107:1":{"text":"Thank me, Sonja!","source_cn":"感谢我吧！索尼娅！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xED2612F129DE65A2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041504108:1":{"text":"Maybe you and I are cut from the same cloth! Hahaha!","source_cn":"你和我，也许才是同类，哈哈哈哈哈！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x25DA9866BE36C883","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041504109:1":{"text":"No... I'm different.","source_cn":"不……我和你不一样。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9C8F37408D90242C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041504110:1":{"text":"For all your power, you're still empty.","source_cn":"你除了力量，一无所有。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDEDC03957E85063C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1041504111:1":{"text":"Even that power was stolen.","source_cn":"就连你的力量，也是你从别处窃取的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1773A764162F6922","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1041504112:1":{"text":"Does it matter where it came from, as long as it serves my purpose?","source_cn":"力量就是力量，只要能为我所用，出处毫无意义！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1B426D88B5AFFF91","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1041504113:1":{"text":"I've crossed paths with many people like you in Rustport.","source_cn":"我在锈锚港见过很多你这样的人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xACB857FCDD3BA5F8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1041504114:1":{"text":"People who think raw power can conquer everything. They end up slaves to it.","source_cn":"妄想通过力量掌控一切……最终都变成了力量的傀儡。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBB18263A426655EE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1041504115:1":{"text":"And what's wrong with being a puppet, so long as I pull the strings?","source_cn":"傀儡又如何，只要足够强，比任何人都要强！我就是那万中无一！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEEC75A48BDBBD6A5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1041504116:1":{"text":"You're beyond redemption.","source_cn":"你已经没救了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF55D73A81E69B965","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1041504117:1":{"text":"Hahaha, I thought you were strong, Sonja.","source_cn":"哈哈哈哈哈，索尼娅，我还以为你是强者。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x242CB83865FD066A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1041504118:1":{"text":"Listen to the way you're speaking to me. Are you actually pitying me?","source_cn":"但瞧你对我说话的语气，你竟然在悲悯我？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x969CEA4B06D1CE45","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1041504119:1":{"text":"The weak sympathizing with the strong? How hilarious!","source_cn":"弱者竟敢悲悯强者？多可笑！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1DD9E20F75C7C774","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1041504120:1":{"text":"If we were on the Immortal, your head would already be dangling from the bow.","source_cn":"要是我还在不死号上，你的头已经被我挂在船头了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBE6025F0B6D70C22","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1041504121:1":{"text":"I know why you keep threatening others with death and torture—you fear them yourselves.","source_cn":"你用死亡和折磨来恐吓别人，不就是因为你一直生活在这种恐...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5B254EA935138807","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1041504122:1":{"text":"Hodgkin, stop acting strong; I've seen through you.","source_cn":"霍德希金，你不必在我面前自诩强者。你早就暴露了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x77C7954CBA54A051","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1041504123:1":{"text":"You're just a clown who's been living in fear.","source_cn":"你只是一直生活在恐惧中的小丑而已。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE3B429A77BF142C0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1041504124:1":{"text":"Hmph... Spare me your speech—it's meaningless.","source_cn":"哼……嘴皮子功夫再厉害也没有意义。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x335F5CEE6C120DCF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1041504125:1":{"text":"Did my words hit home? Sorry, I never beat around the bush.","source_cn":"戳到了你的痛处吗？真抱歉，我向来不喜欢绕弯子。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3DB23F243876E11A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1041504126:1":{"text":"Stay away from me if you don't want to listen.","source_cn":"不想听，那就别来打扰我。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x90C3C1FBE4AEE192","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1041504127:1":{"text":"Don't forget—the blood of my men stains your hands.","source_cn":"别忘了，你的手上还沾着我血薇帮兄弟的血！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7C0F405DDECC3ADA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1041504128:1":{"text":"We're not the same, Hodgkin. Don't ever confuse that.","source_cn":"记住，我和你永远不是一路人！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEE27453378C9A0BF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:霍德希金":{"text":"Hodgkin","source":"霍德希金","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:索尼娅":{"text":"Sonja","source":"索尼娅","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":29,"localized_text_count":28,"speaker_count":2}}